---
import { MapPin, Phone, Mail, Clock, ShieldCheck, Heart } from 'lucide-react';
---

<footer class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-300 py-16 lg:py-24 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-slate-900">
  <!-- Decorative Glows -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-teal-600/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-pink-600/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Top CTA Banner inside Footer -->
    <div class="mb-16 md:mb-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-teal-900/50 transition-colors duration-500">
      <!-- Decorative element -->
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 w-64 h-64 bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl group-hover:bg-teal-500/20 transition-colors duration-700"></div>
      
      <div class="relative z-10 text-center md:text-left max-w-2xl">
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-4">Butuh Bantuan Medis Segera?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Tim Dokter Namira siap melayani konsultasi klinik maupun kunjungan homecare langsung ke rumah Anda. Jangan ragu untuk menghubungi kami kapan saja.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative z-10 shrink-0">
        <a href="https://wa.me/6285270001948?text=Halo%20Dokter%20Namira..." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-400 text-slate-950 font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(20,184,166,0.3)] hover:-translate-y-1">
          <Phone size={18} />
          <span>Hubungi via WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Footer Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 mb-16">
      
      <!-- Brand & About -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-8">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-white p-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors shadow-sm">
          <img src="/logo-dokter-namira.png" alt="Logo Praktek Dokter Namira" class="h-10 w-auto" />
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Praktek dokter umum terpercaya di Malang. Menyediakan layanan medis komprehensif, dokter homecare, bekam medis, infus booster, dan perawatan estetika dasar.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-sm text-slate-300 bg-slate-900/50 w-fit px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
          <ShieldCheck size={18} class="text-teal-400" />
          <span class="font-medium tracking-wide">SIP: <span class="font-mono text-teal-400/80">100.3.12/201.0401</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6">
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-white tracking-wide">Layanan Utama</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/layanan/homecare-malang" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-teal-400 hover:translate-x-1 inline-block transition-all duration-300">Homecare Visit</a></li>
          <li><a href="/layanan/infeksi-menular-seksual" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-teal-400 hover:translate-x-1 inline-block transition-all duration-300">Konsultasi IMS</a></li>
          <li><a href="/layanan/infus-booster-vitamin" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-teal-400 hover:translate-x-1 inline-block transition-all duration-300">Infus & Vitamin</a></li>
          <li><a href="/layanan/bekam-sunnah-fashdu" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-teal-400 hover:translate-x-1 inline-block transition-all duration-300">Bekam & Fashdu</a></li>
          <li><a href="/layanan/syari-beauty-care" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-teal-400 hover:translate-x-1 inline-block transition-all duration-300">Beauty Care</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Area Layanan -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6">
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-white tracking-wide">Area Homecare</h4>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500/50"></div>Seluruh Wilayah Malang</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500/50"></div>Seluruh Wilayah Batu</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6">
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-white tracking-wide">Kontak & Jadwal</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-5 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <MapPin size={18} class="text-teal-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/3MeZCrY49Nifmsp87" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="leading-relaxed hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">
              Ruko Ragali Residence, Jl. Tirto Joyo No.119-69, Merjosari, Malang 65144
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <Phone size={18} class="text-teal-500 shrink-0" />
            <span>0852-7000-1948</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 pt-2">
            <Clock size={18} class="text-teal-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <p><span class="text-slate-300 font-medium">Umum:</span> 06.00 sd 22.00 WIB</p>
              <p><span class="text-slate-300 font-medium">Kecantikan:</span> 09.00-16.00</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 text-[11px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-2 md:gap-4 text-center md:text-left">
        <p class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5"><ShieldCheck size={14} class="text-slate-400" /> Medical Disclaimer: Info bukan diagnosis independen</p>
      </div>
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Praktek Dokter Namira.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
